resets.vhd:27:7: sema/missing-reset: `data` is not reset by `arst_n` in this process, so the reset acts as an enable on it
resets.vhd:36:10: sema/mixed-reset: `arst_n` resets this process synchronously but the process at line 23 asynchronously
resets.vhd:56:8: sema/reset-polarity: `rst` resets when low here but when high at line 47
resets.vhd:67:10: sema/reset-polarity: `rst_n` is named as active low but resets when high here
fsm.vhd:39:12: sema/fsm-stuck-state: `state` never leaves state `DONE` once there, except by a reset
